<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Starbucks raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Starbucks raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it upgraded Starbucks to buy from attractive, the office of analyst Craig Bibb confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 29-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
